      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Extend a video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **First clip**: this box makes a clip.\n3. **Extend it**: the prompt here says what happens next. The line from **task_id** to **source_task_id** tells the box which clip to continue.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. Both parts play here as one clip.\n\nTo extend again, add another **Extend / Edit Clip** box and connect it the same way. An extension is charged for the new seconds and for reading the source clip.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "**Extend a video**\n\nFollow the numbered frames from left to right.\n\n1. **Your key** (first time only): paste your HashBidX key and click **Verify and save key**. The box then shows the last four characters of the saved key.\n2. **First clip**: this box makes a clip.\n3. **Extend it**: the prompt here says what happens next. The line from **task_id** to **source_task_id** tells the box which clip to continue.\n4. **Result**: press **Run**. Both parts play here as one clip.\n\nTo extend again, add another **Extend / Edit Clip** box and connect it the same way. An extension is charged for the new seconds and for reading the source clip.\n\nThe key box is wired to the first HashBidX box. The other HashBidX boxes use the same saved key."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
